# Demo Site Output

## Applies when

Editing or reviewing `leads/{id}/design/**` — built demo site, metadata, and preview screenshots.

Assembly behavior: C `23-agent-design`. Visual QA: C `24-agent-design-critic`. Assets source: B `14-capture`.

## Source of truth

- [PRD.md](PRD.md) §7.2 (`design/build.json`), §8 (`design/dist/`, previews).
- [PRD.md](PRD.md) §14 G4 (build, previews, Design-Critic).
- C `23-agent-design`, C `24-agent-design-critic`.
- B `14-capture-step` (`capture/logo.png`, `capture/photos/*`).

## Required behavior

- **Artifacts**:
  - `design/dist/` — static site ready for Cloudflare Pages
  - `design/build.json` — `template`, `brand_tokens`, `build_dir`, `screens`
  - `design/preview-desktop.png`, `design/preview-mobile.png` — for Design-Critic (G4)
- **Real client assets**: when `capture/logo.png` or `capture/photos/*` exist — reuse in demo; no stock placeholders.
- **Not generic AI-template**: niche copy from `content.json` visible; client logo when available; sellable look per G4 rubric.
- **Responsive**: no horizontal overflow on mobile/desktop (G4 code check).
- **build.json**: `template` name recorded (e.g. `clinic-v1`); `brand_tokens` from capture + design-system defaults.
- **Manual edits**: prefer re-run Design stage over hand-editing `design/dist/` without updating `build.json` and previews.
- **Previews required** before Design-Critic — do not skip PNG generation.

## When user requests forbidden pattern

- «Демо без логотипа клиента когда capture/logo.png есть» → stop; D4 + C `23-agent-design`.
- «Placeholder stock images вместо capture» → stop; real assets when present.
- «Пропусти preview PNGs» → stop; G4 requires previews (`03-pipeline-gates`).
- «React SPA в design/dist» → stop; static HTML per `00-project-overview`.

## Forbidden behavior

- Do not ship empty or broken `design/dist/`.
- Do not use framework SPA in demo output.
- Do not omit `template` in `build.json`.
- Do not modify `design/dist/` without regenerating previews and syncing `build.json`.
- Do not ignore `content.json` slot content in rendered UI.

## Output requirements

- Valid static build under `leads/{id}/design/dist/`.
- `build.json` validates against `schemas/design-build.schema.json` when present.
- Both preview PNGs exist before G4 critic runs.

## Verification checklist

- [ ] Client logo reused when `capture/logo.png` exists.
- [ ] `preview-desktop.png` and `preview-mobile.png` present.
- [ ] `template` and `brand_tokens` in `build.json`.
- [ ] Niche copy visible — not generic filler.
- [ ] G4 code checks pass (build, overflow, console) before critic.
